# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project-specific additions
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Eleventy build output — Cloudflare Pages generates this on deploy;
# we never commit the generated site to git.
# Local AI-agent scratch worktrees.
.claude/worktrees/
.codex/

# Per-user / per-machine Claude Code permission allowlist.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Large reference PDFs that exceed GitHub's 100MB file size limit.
# Keep these locally; commit text extracts (e.g., *-extract.txt) instead.
sources/FS/Histoire_de_Lorraine_*.pdf

# Local-only media: oversize (>35 MB), copyright-restricted, or privacy-sensitive
# originals. See sources/media/_local/README.md and .claude/rules/sources.md (sources/media/ section).
# Commit a stub in the parent folder describing what lives locally and where the
# canonical master can be retrieved.
# Ignore _local/ contents (not the directory itself, so README can be re-included).
sources/media/_local/*
sources/media/*/_local/*
# But always commit the README that describes what's parked locally.
!sources/media/_local/README.md
!sources/media/*/_local/README.md

# Local retention stores. Lead-catalog backups are kept for 30 days by
# tools/research_leads.py; paleography derivatives are kept for at least 7 days
# unless intentionally culled by the creator.
research/future-research/_local/
sources/intake/paleography-staging/_local/

# Paleography staging working-snippets: regenerable derivative crops, line strips,
# enhancement sheets, and contact sheets. Local-only — they are reproducible from the
# master image + the manifest coordinates. The durable keepers are the master images
# (-> sources/media/<id>/_local/) and the packet reports (-> sources/corpus_supplement/).
# See .claude/skills/paleography-analysis/SKILL.md.
sources/intake/paleography-staging/working-snippets/

# Local package cache used when npm is unavailable in the sandbox.
site/website/.pkg-cache/
site/website/.npm-cache/

# Historical exported site bundles kept for local reference only.
site/gurney-eleventy-project_source_clean_*.zip
site/gurney-eleventy-project_source_clean_*/

site/_site/
site/dist/
site/**/_site/
site/**/dist/
_site/

# Accidentally-rendered temp/preview HTML written to the repo root
# (mangled OS temp paths leaked from local site previews). Real pages
# live under site/, never at the repo root.
/Usersallen*.html
/*AppDataLocalTemp*

# Editor / OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Secrets
*.pem
secrets.json

# Ephemeral intake scratch and Python bytecode cache
sources/intake/_workspace/
tools/__pycache__/
